Package: tteICE
Type: Package
Title: Treatment Effect Estimation for Time-to-Event Data with
        Intercurrent Events
Version: 1.1.5
Author: Yuhao Deng [aut],
  Yi Zhou [cre]
Maintainer: Yi Zhou <yzhou@pku.edu.cn>
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Yuhao",
                      family = "Deng",
